  "C40_reference_disposition": "Retain C40 as the best available validated corrected TP3 performance reference within its declared gates, with seeded batch invariance explicitly not established by this observational collector. Do not retroactively invalidate it or treat it as automatically promotable; owner acceptance, outstanding TP4 and other release limits are unchanged.",
