    "before_run": "Classify each collector output/predicate in the experiment plan as a required gate or an observation, naming exact expected values, shapes, scenarios and completeness requirements.",
    "required_gate": "Require process exit0 AND every predeclared semantic predicate. Missing/malformed required output, declared false verdict or skipped required coverage must block timing/progression even if the process exited0.",
    "observation": "Preserve false/differing values and a clearly named limitation without a passed-gate badge. Do not turn every observational collector identical:false into a runtime failure.",
